Howe et al., 2021
) Mus_musculus.GRCm38.102.gtf.gz (27 October 2020) and Mus_musculus.GRCm38.102.uniprot.tsv.gz (26 October 2020). UK Biobank exome sequencing data was accessed through the Genebass webserver (
Karczewski et al., 2022
).
shRNA:rAAV6 production
All shRNA sequences are shown in
